| + depth prior, floater suppression | 13.12 | 0.569 | 0.650 | 16.18 | 0.621 | 0.646 |
| + shell completion (RoomFill) | 12.17 | 0.597 | 0.653 | 16.20 | 0.643 | 0.622 |

